Adapted components include notch-window geometry and shape, non-activating
panel event handling, pointer dwell tracking, snippet persistence, and their
original regression tests. NotchCopy adds a focused snippet-only application,
hidden lower-edge activation, dual-display boundary handling, a compact UI,
full-text preview, copy-and-dismiss with focus restoration, keyboard navigation,
local daily backups, independent branding, packaging, and project documentation.

The original project's name, icon, release binaries, unrelated modules, and
personal snippet data are not included in this distribution.
